      "intro": { "en": "The Qianlong Emperor is completing the conquest of the Dzungars. Qing China is the richest state on earth and trades with Europeans only at Canton.", "cn": "乾隆皇帝正在完成对准噶尔的征服。大清是世界上最富有的国家，只在广州与欧洲人通商。" },
      "color": [235, 200, 70], "techLevel": 2, "capital": [116.40, 39.90], "garrison": 2, "fleets": 2,
