    { "id": "mug", "art": "in", "faction": "mughal", "tags": ["empire"], "name": { "en": "MUGHAL EMPIRE", "cn": "莫卧儿帝国" },
      "intro": { "en": "Emperor Alamgir II still reigns in Delhi, but the Marathas, the Nizam, the Nawab of Bengal and the Afghans have taken most of what Aurangzeb ruled. Europeans trade at the coasts by his leave.", "cn": "阿拉姆吉尔二世仍在德里称帝，但马拉塔人、尼扎姆、孟加拉纳瓦卜和阿富汗人已夺走了奥朗则布统治的大部分土地。欧洲人在他的许可下在沿海贸易。" },
      "color": [70, 160, 80], "techLevel": 2, "capital": [77.21, 28.61], "garrison": 1,
      "flag": { "bands": ["#2e7d32"], "overlays": [
