    { "id": "per", "faction": "persia", "tags": ["kingdom"], "name": { "en": "PERSIA", "cn": "波斯" },
      "intro": { "en": "Nader Shah's empire has fallen apart since his murder. Karim Khan Zand is winning the struggle for Persia; Khorasan is held by Nader's grandson under Afghan protection.", "cn": "纳迪尔沙遇刺后，他的帝国四分五裂。卡里姆汗·赞德正在赢得波斯的争夺；呼罗珊由纳迪尔的孙子在阿富汗人的庇护下统治。" },
